function assignments(d){return (state._snapshots||[state]).flatMap(source=>calculateAssignments(source,d).map(t=>({...t,...scopeTag(source)}))).sort((a,b)=>a.due_time.localeCompare(b.due_time)||a.id.localeCompare(b.id))}
